usage: yodea [--server URL] push [--dir D] [--project P] [--static]

Check the folder is a Vite React TS app unless --static, pack dist/ (index.html
required) as a raw gzipped tar, and upload it. Prints the preview
URL plus file and byte counts.

Options:
  -dir string
    	project folder (default ".")
  -project string
    	project name (default: yodea.json, then folder name)
  -static
    	publish prepared dist/ without React TypeScript validation
